{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":254659,\"title\":\"A Demon for Trouble\",\"tagline\":\"A THUNDERBOLT FROM THE WEST!\",\"overview\":\"Dyer is buying ranches and then retrieving his check by having his gang kill the owner. Bob Worth arrives just as Buck Morton is killed and gets blamed for the murder. Fleeing from the Sheriff, Bob teams up with the Mexican outlaw Golinda. Having seen Dyer pay off his men, he has a plan to trap him and Golinda is just the man he needs to make it work.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lQ6Yy88UZfSX34rWi7dksZnHSVD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1qNoi4ZDedPB5ceoIbnUbZee3Xg.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":3,\"year\":1934,\"runtime\":58,\"genres\":[\"Western\",\"Romance\",\"Action\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Robert F. Hill\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":33690,\"name\":\"Robert F. Hill\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":88649,\"name\":\"Bob Steele\",\"character\":\"Bob Worth\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jOaQFxwyNWRNEEdRoiiRaOVrOpK.jpg\"},{\"id\":85426,\"name\":\"Don Alvarado\",\"character\":\"Golinda\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8ALQlPCzVEYjAz3nBlWYGV9UzhR.jpg\"},{\"id\":996808,\"name\":\"Gloria Shea\",\"character\":\"Lita Morton\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3NhaPewciJIP3Z2Xc7IfwD7tWXc.jpg\"},{\"id\":1199452,\"name\":\"Nick Stuart\",\"character\":\"Buck Morton\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eTNssAQpJSZWTmzYjiFvl5DrI8O.jpg\"},{\"id\":121411,\"name\":\"Walter McGrail\",\"character\":\"Dyer\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ctOCxa0EQ6b2H2BL3d1BzeGyPaQ.jpg\"},{\"id\":939834,\"name\":\"Carmen Laroux\",\"character\":\"Maya\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":124634,\"name\":\"Lafe McKee\",\"character\":\"Sheriff\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iDR6BFkx3vJY9dN3LA3bNTAK24J